  "verseCount": 40,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "8",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CH 8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The Genealogy of Saul the Benjamite",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Benjamin was the father of:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 8:1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bela his firstborn,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 8:1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ashbel the second son, Aharah the third,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nohah the fourth and Rapha the fifth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Bela were:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 8:3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Addar, Gera, Abihud,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abishua, Naaman, Ahoah,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gera, Shephuphan and Huram.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These were the descendants of Ehud, who were heads of families of those living in Geba and were deported to Manahath:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naaman, Ahijah, and Gera, who deported them and who was the father of Uzza and Ahihud.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sons were born to Shaharaim in Moab after he had divorced his wives Hushim and Baara.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "By his wife Hodesh he had Jobab, Zibia, Mesha, Malkam,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jeuz, Sakia and Mirmah. These were his sons, heads of families.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "By Hushim he had Abitub and Elpaal.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Elpaal:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 8:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eber, Misham, Shemed (who built Ono and Lod with its surrounding villages),",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and Beriah and Shema, who were heads of families of those living in Aijalon and who drove out the inhabitants of Gath.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahio, Shashak, Jeremoth,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zebadiah, Arad, Eder,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Michael, Ishpah and Joha were the sons of Beriah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zebadiah, Meshullam, Hizki, Heber,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ishmerai, Izliah and Jobab were the sons of Elpaal.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jakim, Zikri, Zabdi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elienai, Zillethai, Eliel,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adaiah, Beraiah and Shimrath were the sons of Shimei.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ishpan, Eber, Eliel,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abdon, Zikri, Hanan,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hananiah, Elam, Anthothijah,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iphdeiah and Penuel were the sons of Shashak.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shamsherai, Shehariah, Athaliah,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jaareshiah, Elijah and Zikri were the sons of Jeroham.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "lf"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All these were heads of families, chiefs as listed in their genealogy, and they lived in Jerusalem.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jeiel",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "the father",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "of Gibeon lived in Gibeon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 8:29"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "His wife's name was Maakah,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and his firstborn son was Abdon, followed by Zur, Kish, Baal, Ner,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Nadab,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gedor, Ahio, Zeker",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and Mikloth, who was the father of Shimeah. They too lived near their relatives in Jerusalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ner was the father of Kish, Kish the father of Saul, and Saul the father of Jonathan, Malki-Shua, Abinadab and Esh-Baal.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The son of Jonathan:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 8:34"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Merib-Baal,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "who was the father of Micah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Micah:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 8:35"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Pithon, Melek, Tarea and Ahaz.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahaz was the father of Jehoaddah, Jehoaddah was the father of Alemeth, Azmaveth and Zimri, and Zimri was the father of Moza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moza was the father of Binea; Raphah was his son, Eleasah his son and Azel his son.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azel had six sons, and these were their names:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 8:38"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Azrikam, Bokeru, Ishmael, Sheariah, Obadiah and Hanan. All these were the sons of Azel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of his brother Eshek:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 8:39"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ulam his firstborn, Jeush the second son and Eliphelet the third.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Ulam were brave warriors who could handle the bow. They had many sons and grandsons—150 in all.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "1CH 8:40"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "All these were the descendants of Benjamin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
